[en.FOCUS_C01_RECONSTRUCTION]
Post-war Reconstruction

[en.FOCUS_C01_RECONSTRUCTION_desc]
The Equestria Empire is just established, and everything is to be done. Although ponies have lost everything, they have gained liberation - the wise leadership of Empress Cozy Glow will lead ponies into a new era. Because ponies are eager to rebuild the country, they can even work without pay. Thus a large-scale infrastructure construction should be immediately launched, which may be a good start for post-war economic recovery.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_RECONSTRUCTION]
废墟上的重建

[zh.FOCUS_C01_RECONSTRUCTION_desc]
小马利亚帝国成立初，百废待兴。虽然小马们失去了一切，但是他们获得了解放——和煦光流女皇的英明领导将会带领小马们迈向新的时代。由于小马们迫切地想要重新建设这个国家，这样甚至可以不需要向他们支付工资。因此，立即开展大规模的基础设施建设，可能是战后经济复苏的一个良好开端。

